---
type: agent/instruction
description: Instructions for sending {{workflow.file}} content to the mcp server
requires-workflow: true
---
Read the exact configured path `{{workflow.file}}` directly; do not use a glob,
repository search, or tracked-file listing. If it exists, send its COMPLETE
content using the {{tool_prefix}}send_file_content tool. If a direct read
confirms it is absent, create it to record the current workflow state, using
`phase: discussion` when no other phase has been selected, then send its
complete content.

**Note:** Do NOT display the file content to the user when calling send_file_content - only show the confirmation message.
